{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-words-panel-screens-2-01","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"10","surface":"panel","area":"panel/screens-2","refs":["F-panel-1113","F-panel-1123","F-panel-1125","F-panel-1131","F-panel-534"],"severity":"S4","title":"In Hinglish, Money, Trainers, Workout plans, Workout of the day, Pay MettleUp, receipts and most of Settings stay in English","what":"An owner who picks Hinglish sees Today, Members, Plans and the join-online step in Hinglish, but Money, Trainers, Workout plans, Workout of the day, Pay MettleUp, both receipts, Member questions and the Messages and offers heading never change, and Settings and the web page editor change only a few lines.","expected":"Every screen an owner uses most days reads in the language they picked, or the switch says which screens are Hinglish so far.","evidence":["apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/Money.tsx:106-108","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/Trainers.tsx:604","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/WorkoutPlans.tsx:131-132","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/PayMettleUp.tsx:136-137","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/Settings.tsx:81-83","apps/dashboard/src/crm/lang/hinglish.ts:11-12"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"hinglish-covers-first-day-screens-only","who":"owners and desk staff who chose Hinglish","how_often":"every time they open these pages","fix_line":"Put these pages' words through the language switch and add their Hinglish lines","fix_size":"medium","needs_him":true,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-words-panel-screens-2-02","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"10","surface":"panel","area":"panel/screens-2","refs":["F-panel-333"],"severity":"S4","title":"A trainer's page says members see what the trainer teaches, but the member app never shows it","what":"Under 'What they teach' the trainer page says 'Members and the desk see this'. Only the admin app's trainer screens read it; nothing on the member's phone asks for it or shows it.","expected":"The hint says only the desk and trainers see it, or the member app shows it.","evidence":["apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/Trainers.tsx:1046","supabase/migrations/0065_trainer_schedule.sql:13-16","supabase/migrations/0065_trainer_schedule.sql:111"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"trainer-teaches-not-in-member-app","who":"owners and trainers filling in a trainer page","how_often":"every time a trainer page is edited","fix_line":"Change the hint to 'The desk and trainers see this', or show it in the member app","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-words-panel-screens-2-03","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-10","surface":"panel","area":"panel/screens-2","refs":["F-panel-317","F-panel-533"],"severity":"S4","title":"The MettleUp Plus lock Save button is greyed when nothing changed, with no word that it is already saved","what":"On the Plus lock card the Save button stays grey until the switch is moved. Nothing next to it says the current choice is already saved, so an owner can think Save is broken.","expected":"A short line like 'Already saved' beside the grey button, as the web page editor does.","evidence":["apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/PlusLock.tsx:87-95"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"grey-save-no-saved-word","who":"owners","how_often":"every time the card is opened","fix_line":"Show 'Already saved' next to the grey Save button","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
